SUMMARY:AVL Sounds Fest Friday
DESCRIPTION:AVL Sounds Fest will fill more than 15 area concert halls\, clubs\, and outdoor venues alike with a multi-genre lineup of local\, regional\, and national talent. Performances are set to take place throughout the 4-day festival\, with wristbands granting pass holders access to more than 200 shows throughout the Asheville area. \n \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/avl-sounds-fest-2/
LOCATION:Asheville Area
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-082704-e1785846482360.png
END:VEVENT
