DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we often come across Electronic & DJ events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. Please verify the DJ\, times and cover charges with the venue. \n  \nLA Pizza Party Rooftop – 6-9pm \nThe Radical – 6-11pm \nPotential New Boyfriend – 7:30-11pm \nCapella On 9 – 8-11pm \nBen’s Tune Up – 8-11pm \nSide B Bar Black Mountain – 8pm-12am \nThe Tiki Easy Bar – 9pm-12am \nBanks Ave – 9-11:30pm \nHavana Miami – 9pm-2am \nStatic Age Loft – 9pm-2am \nWaterstreet – 9pm-2am \nNightshade – 9pm-1am \nVOWL – 9pm-1am \nBarleys Upstairs – 10pm-1am \nThe Well West Asheville – 10pm-1am \nLa Pizza Party South Slope – 10pm-2am \nFarməse – 10pm-1am \nThe Barksdale – 10pm-2am \nDouble Crown – 10pm-2am \nLazy Diamond – 10pm-2am \nStrange Magic Bar – 10pm-2am \nShakeys – 10pm-2am \nVerify with the venue on time\, cover charges and tonight’s DJ.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/friday-weekly-djs/2026-08-07/
