BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T230000
DTSTAMP:20260802T191010Z
CREATED:20260727T192710Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260802T191010Z
UID:10082512-1786132800-1786143600@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Justin Ray Quartet
DESCRIPTION:Trumpeter & Vocalist Justin Ray brings his quartet to the stage alongside Tim Fischer on guitar\, Steve LaSpina on bass and Alan Hall on Drums for an evening of world-class jazz. \nA Berklee College of Music graduate\, Justin has performed with artists including Michael Bublé\, Kurt Elling\, Dave Weckl\, Kamasi Washington\, and more. During his nearly 20 years with Michael Bublé’s band\, he toured internationally\, appeared on Grammy-winning recordings\, and performed at iconic venues including Madison Square Garden\, the Hollywood Bowl\, Radio City Music Hall\, and the Sydney Opera House. Now based in Asheville\, Justin is also an acclaimed composer\, arranger\, and educator whose performances blend virtuosic musicianship with deep jazz tradition. \n$10 weekdays -$15 weekends at the door (all ticket proceeds are 100% passed to the band\, backed by a living wage guarantee from Hotel Eve) \n*Reserve a table in advance\, or join us impromptu the night of the show. Reservations/advance tickets are recommended for preferred seating\, but not required. Tickets are available at the door on a first-come\, first-served basis.  Event Details and Tickets \nHotel Eve is your locally rooted\, speakeasy jazz club & cocktail bar\, hidden in the heart of Downtown Asheville. Mysteriously not a hotel…check in for spirits\, souls and jazz! We’re tucked away\, on purpose. You’ll find us behind the gate nestled between Virtue Boutique and Dane Wells Gallery at 56 N Lexington Avenue in downtown Asheville. Step through\, take a left into the courtyard\, check in for Spirits\, Souls & Jazz. We’ll be waiting on the other side. hotelevejazz.com \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/justin-ray-quartet/
LOCATION:Hotel Eve Jazz\, 56 N Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/unnamed-e1785697765365.jpg
GEO:35.5967716;-82.5530826
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Hotel Eve Jazz 56 N Lexington Avenue Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=56 N Lexington Avenue:geo:-82.5530826,35.5967716
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T230000
DTSTAMP:20260805T115311Z
CREATED:20260805T011931Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T115311Z
UID:10084141-1786132800-1786143600@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Jess & Jill
DESCRIPTION:THIS FRIDAY! August 7th 🌟 Jess & Jill are the award-winning Americana duo of Jesse Wagner and Jillian Todd\, three-time Key West Duo of the Year winners. Blending influences from Jerry Garcia\, Joni Mitchell\, Gillian Welch\, and David Rawlings\, their heartfelt sound weaves together folk\, bluegrass\, Celtic\, funk\, and jam-band roots. Now based in Asheville\, they’re recording their debut album of original music at Echo Mountain Recording and captivating audiences with rich harmonies\, honest songwriting\, and undeniable chemistry 🧪 💚🍃🦎🦠 9-12 \nShiloh & Gaines – Your neighborhood bar……no matter where you live. \nCoffee ~ Spirits ~ Pool ~ Darts ~ Live Music ~ Dog Friendly ~ Karaoke & More! Find our music schedule and more at shilohandgaines.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jess-jill/
LOCATION:Shiloh & Gaines\, 700 Hendersonville Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28803\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_6156-e1785892762776.jpeg
GEO:35.5471263;-82.533941
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Shiloh & Gaines 700 Hendersonville Rd Asheville NC 28803 NC 28803 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=700 Hendersonville Rd:geo:-82.533941,35.5471263
END:VEVENT
